===Etymology===
From {{der|en|LL.|mammona||wealth}}, from Hellenistic {{der|en|grc|μαμωνᾶς}}, from {{der|en|arc|מָמוֹנָא|tr=māmōnā|gloss=money, wealth}}. Compare {{cog|he|מָמוֹן|tr=mamón|t=money}}.

